  "subject": "A 68-year-old retired storeroom clerk, Uncle Fai, gets new dentures that whistle on every four and every ten he says, so his wife can hear him coming from two streets away and finally catches him sneaking barbecue pork buns.",
  "caption": "Cantonese Bhangra-pop, bouncing dhol groove. Dhol playing the driving bhangra pattern with sharp open strokes, tumbi plucked riff, acoustic guitar strumming on the offbeat, fretless bass, dholki and hand claps. warm live-room recording, dhol forward and punchy, dry crisp percussion. male tenor, bright and cheeky, full chest voice, clearly sung melody on every line. Clear full voice, every word enunciated, steady sung melody on every line. 104 BPM, G minor. Teasing, bouncy, affectionate dance groove. No trap drums, no autotune, no rap, no EDM drops, no synth pads, no slow ballad sections.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n輝叔六十八 新裝咗副假牙\n一講個四字 就吹起哨嚟\n一講個十字 又吹多一下\n成條街都聽到 佢嚟\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n阿嬸喺廚房 聽到哨音\n即刻放低鑊鏟\n\n[Chorus]\n嘟 嘟 嘟 輝叔嚟喇\n講到四字 嘟嘟嘟\n阿嬸一聽 就知道\n你又偷食 叉燒包\n\n[Verse]\n想偷偷哋 買個包\n行入茶餐廳 先講一聲\n老闆話 四蚊一個呀\n哨聲一響 全舖都笑\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n佢掩住個口 退後兩步\n個哨 偏偏更加響\n\n[Chorus]\n嘟 嘟 嘟 輝叔嚟喇\n講到十字 嘟嘟嘟\n阿嬸喺轉角 等住你\n咬咗一啖 又畀你捉\n\n[Verse]\n佢喺屋企練習 慢慢講\n四十四 又四十\n個哨似水煲 滾晒\n隻貓都嚇到 跳上櫃\n\n[Bridge]\n阿嬸忍唔住 笑到彎腰\n話我鍾意 聽你吹\n\n[Chorus]\n嘟 嘟 嘟 輝叔嚟喇\n講到愛字 嘟都唔響\n阿嬸攬住佢 笑住話\n包留低 我分你一半\n\n[Outro]\n四個包 你兩個 我兩個\n嘟 嘟 輝叔 食飯喇",
